66
00:02:20,790 --> 00:02:22,810
Now, whether it's an unconditional jump

67
00:02:22,810 --> 00:02:24,110
or a conditional jump,

68
00:02:24,110 --> 00:02:26,110
as long as it's a control flow

69
00:02:26,110 --> 00:02:28,270
